    check("the back wears the badge's dirt (a stage 4 back is not a stage 0 one)", len(bh) == 6 and all(v["wears"] for v in bh), [v["wears"] for v in bh])

    # CENTRED (b321d, after b321c's badgeSlotShift): every one of the sixteen,
